00:00:18.351 --> 00:00:19.719
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:19.719 --> 00:00:22.888
Heidi, since you're the guest,
why don't you go first?

00:00:22.888 --> 00:00:25.558
Let's start
the dance move generator.

00:00:25.558 --> 00:00:28.961
When you're ready.

00:00:28.961 --> 00:00:30.763
Invisible hula hoop.

00:00:30.763 --> 00:00:32.265
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:32.265 --> 00:00:33.966
That should be a dance.

00:00:33.966 --> 00:00:35.034
Roots, can we get a beat?

00:00:35.034 --> 00:00:36.903
♪♪

00:00:40.606 --> 00:00:44.377 line:0%
Hey, whoa, hey, whoa, whoa,
whoa, whoa, hey, whoa!

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:46.112 line:0%
Whoa!

00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:46.979 line:0%
Hey!

00:00:46.979 --> 00:00:50.883 line:0%
Oh, my goodness!
Oh, my goodness!

00:00:50.883 --> 00:00:53.386 line:0%
Come on. Who does it better
than Heidi Klum?

00:00:53.386 --> 00:00:55.655
That should be a dance.

00:00:55.655 --> 00:00:57.823
Do I have to -- Do I have to go?

00:00:57.823 --> 00:01:00.059
