-Yes.

00:01:24.283 --> 00:01:26.986
-So, am I the --
All right, I got it.

00:01:26.986 --> 00:01:29.155
Fork in the garbage disposal.
Okay, gotcha.

00:01:29.155 --> 00:01:31.191 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:37.163 --> 00:01:40.200 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:50.976 --> 00:01:56.082 line:0%
The first thing, putting
the fork in, then I became --

00:01:56.082 --> 00:01:58.184
I became the fork...
-I saw that.

00:01:58.184 --> 00:01:59.552
-...in front of your eyes
like magic.

00:01:59.552 --> 00:02:01.987
-I saw that. it was good.
It was good.

00:02:01.987 --> 00:02:04.323
-I'm the David Blaine of dance.
-Do I have another shot?

00:02:04.323 --> 00:02:05.457
-Yes, you do. Of course.

00:02:05.457 --> 00:02:07.093
Let's start
the dance battle generator.

00:02:07.093 --> 00:02:09.295
