You have to bowl very fast.

00:02:20.939 --> 00:02:23.643
-The good thing is
I brought my bowling balls.

00:02:25.478 --> 00:02:28.481 line:0%
♪♪

00:02:28.948 --> 00:02:31.284 line:0%
-Oh, hey, whoa.

00:02:31.284 --> 00:02:35.454 line:0%
All right, yeah.

00:02:35.454 --> 00:02:37.857 line:0%
Heidi, that way.
The pins are that way.

00:02:39.425 --> 00:02:43.229 line:0%
Heidi, hey, whoa! Heidi, Heidi!

00:02:43.229 --> 00:02:44.197 line:0%
Heidi, all right, that's enough.

00:02:44.197 --> 00:02:45.564 line:0%
Hey, you got it!
