00:02:50.703 --> 00:02:53.906
We got the score.
You got a -- You got a --

00:02:53.906 --> 00:02:55.908
Trust me.
You got a perfect game.

00:02:55.908 --> 00:02:57.477
You got a 300. Oh, my goodness.

00:02:57.477 --> 00:02:59.078
[ Laughter ]

00:02:59.078 --> 00:03:00.846
