00:03:00.846 --> 00:03:02.014
Okay. Perfect.

00:03:02.014 --> 00:03:03.682
-I'm very competitive.

00:03:03.682 --> 00:03:06.052
-Dance generator,
let's see what you've got.

00:03:07.353 --> 00:03:08.855
Gosh.

00:03:12.358 --> 00:03:13.359
