00:03:17.396 --> 00:03:20.366
-Mom tries --
Mom tries hip-hop.

00:03:20.366 --> 00:03:22.468
-She's cool. She's a cool mom.

00:03:22.468 --> 00:03:23.469
-A cool mom.

00:03:23.469 --> 00:03:24.637
Yeah, sure. Yeah.

00:03:24.637 --> 00:03:26.673 line:0%
♪♪

00:03:32.178 --> 00:03:34.214 line:0%
